<title>USA: Ziegler completes acquisition of GS2.</title>
<headline>Ziegler completes acquisition of GS2.</headline>
<dateline>WEST BEND, Wis. 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ziegler Co Inc said it has completed its acquisition of the Milwaukee-based financial services company Glaisner, Schilffarth, Grande &amp; Schnoll Ltd and its broker-dealer subsidiary GS2 Securities Inc.</p>
<p>In a relesae dated July 2, the company said GS2 is now a wholly owned subsidiary of Ziegler.</p>
<p>Ziegler is a financial services holding company based in West Bend, Wis.  Its principal subsidiary is the broker-dealer B.C. Ziegler and Co.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
